<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>OTP Verification</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 520px;
        background: #ffffff;
        margin: 50px auto;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #00a8ff);
        color: #fff;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 25px 15px;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 30px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .content h2 {
        color: #111;
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .content p {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #555;
      }

      .otp {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
        background: #f0f0f0;
        padding: 10px 25px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
        color: #007bff;
      }

      .footer {
        background: #f0f3f6;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #777;
        padding: 15px;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #007bff;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .header img {
        width: 50px;
        height: 28.5px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        /* box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); */
      }
      .header {
        display: flex;
        /* align-items: center; */
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/yFg26sk5/logo.png" alt="VaultPay Logo" />
        <h1>VaultPay</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>OTP Verification</h2>
        <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
        <p>Your One-Time Password (OTP) for VaultPay is:</p>
        <div class="otp"><%= otp %></div>
        <p>This OTP is valid for <strong><%= otpExpirationTime %></strong> minutes. Please do not share it with anyone.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> VaultPay. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
